OL,3,GNEWSACalls for clarity on future of
OL,4,A'unsafe' footbridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners say they want clarity over
OL,7,Fthe future of a 19th Century pedestrian
OL,8,Ffootbridge which has been closed for
OL,9,Fsafety reasons since July.
OL,11,FWork began on 24 August to remove Oxhey
OL,12,FGrange bridge over the West Coast
OL,13,Fmainline in Watford after a Network
OL,14,FRail inspection found it was unsafe.
OL,16,FA spokesperson for the Oxhey Village
OL,17,FEnvironment Group (OVEG) said: "The
OL,18,Fimpact is that a section of our
OL,19,Fcommunity is cut in two, and residents
OL,20,Fincluding those less physically able
OL,21,Fare forced to add an extra mile on to
OL,22,Ftheir journey."
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
