OL,3,GNEWSACalls for clarity on future of
OL,4,A'unsafe' footbridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Network Rail spokesperson said it was
OL,7,F"finalising plans to safely remove the
OL,8,Fexisting bridge, and developing the
OL,9,Fmethodology for its replacement".
